# Engine settings: a name and a value a line; '#' starts a comment. Read from src:/config in dev
# builds, from game:/config (the cooker copies it) in ship.

# The world deengine opens (--world overrides): content/world/test/test.world
world   76d76b87e8562965

# Temporal anti-aliasing at start: on or off (F3 toggles it in dev builds).
taa     on

# What F6 and F7 drop in dev builds, to see physics: a model's GUID (its meta has it): content/props/boulder_01/boulder_01.gltf
debug_drop_mesh   6681c1d7-0c12-4528-9523-2642e902ae2d
